          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia atahya, bamubyalira omu magashani ag'oruguru ag'abakama abasikiire Daudi. Yuda yona na Yerusalemu bamutekera orufu orushongore; Manase omutabani amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
